rogramming &amp; Databases: Solid foundation in Python and SQL / Google SQL for data extraction, manipulation, and pipeline creation.Google Ecosystem &amp; AI Tooling: Hands-on experience with Google Sheets, Looker Studio, Gemini models, and LLM APIs, alongside workflow automation via JavaScript / Google Apps Script.Modern Frameworks: Familiarity with Model Context Protocol (MCP) standards for dynamic context sharing and tool orchestration.BI &amp; Visualization: Expertise in data visualization platforms like Tableau, Power BI, or Looker Studio.Soft Skills &amp; MindsetAnalytical Thinking: Naturally curious with high attention to detail and a passion for independent problem-solving.Communication: Excellent verbal and written communication skills to convey findings effectively to technical and non-technical stakeholders.</span></div><div jsname="G7vtgf" class="TOQyFc Uzkg7d MmMIvd brKmxb" aria-controls="tsuid_evn4ao_dDb6y4-EP2pbpoQI_219" role="button" tabindex="0" jsaction="EMtXr" data-l="" data-hveid="CCYQTg" data-ved="2ahUKEwiPguXl2IiYAxU-2TgGHVpLOiQQl5ACegQIJhBO"><hr class="Bi9oQd" aria-hidden="true"><div class="Wjtive btku5b rXoM2c sjVJQd"><div class="niO4u VDgVie SlP8xc"><span class="cHaqb"><span class="PBBEhf">Show full description</span></span><span class="T2xY9b w2fKdd z1asCe" aria-hidden="true" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M480-344L240-584l56-56L480-456L664-640l56,56L480-344Z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="XFOJCe" data-ved="2ahUKEwiPguXl2IiYAxU-2TgGHVpLOiQQ5ZkFegQIJhBP"><div class="EyBRub" data-ved="2ahUKEwiPguXl2IiYAxU-2TgGHVpLOiQQyo8CegQIJhBQ"><div jscontroller="Wo3n8" jsname="aadvhe" jsmodel=" d5EhJe" data-bkt="horizon_jobs" data-fhs="" data-maindata='[null,null,"bind(&#39;java/com/google/gws/plugins/horizon/jobs/viewer/herocontent/jslayout/feedback_messages.html#JobAtEmployer&#39;,{employer_name