ent communication skills with the ability to translate technical insights into clear business language.<br>• Strong attention to detail and a passion for understanding how work truly gets done at scale.</span></div><div jsname="G7vtgf" class="TOQyFc Uzkg7d MmMIvd brKmxb" aria-controls="tsuid_evn4ao_dDb6y4-EP2pbpoQI_220" role="button" tabindex="0" jsaction="EMtXr" data-l="" data-hveid="CCoQTA" data-ved="2ahUKEwiPguXl2IiYAxU-2TgGHVpLOiQQl5ACegQIKhBM"><hr class="Bi9oQd" aria-hidden="true"><div class="Wjtive btku5b rXoM2c sjVJQd"><div class="niO4u VDgVie SlP8xc"><span class="cHaqb"><span class="PBBEhf">Show full description</span></span><span class="T2xY9b w2fKdd z1asCe" aria-hidden="true" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M480-344L240-584l56-56L480-456L664-640l56,56L480-344Z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="XFOJCe" data-ved="2ahUKEwiPguXl2IiYAxU-2TgGHVpLOiQQ5ZkFegQIKhBN"><div class="EyBRub" data-ved="2ahUKEwiPguXl2IiYAxU-2TgGHVpLOiQQyo8CegQIKhBO"><div jscontroller="Wo3n8" jsname="aadvhe" jsmodel=" d5EhJe" data-bkt="horizon_jobs" data-fhs="" data-maindata='[null,null,"bind(&#39;java/com/google/gws/plugins/horizon/jobs/viewer/herocontent/jslayout/feedback_messages.html#JobAtEmployer&#39;,{employer_name:&#39;Skan.ai&#39;,job_title:&#39;Data Analyst II&#39;})","_evn4ao_dDb6y4-EP2pbpoQI_229",null,13,null,null,null,null,null,5025273,"horizon_jobs",[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[["share_link","https://www.google.com/search?q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Bengaluru+with+4+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026hl\u003den\u0026ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026udm\u003d8"],["jobs_posting_urls_1","https://www.foundit.in/job/data-analyst-ii-skan-ai-bengaluru-bangalore-48143855?utm_campaign\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\u0026utm_source\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\u0026utm_medium\u003dorganic"],["jobs_posting_domain_1",""],["jobs_posting_urls_2","https://in.jooble