rma / Life Sciences Analytics.<br>Strong hands-on experience with Oracle PL/SQL.<br>Strong knowledge of SQL and statistical analysis.<br>Experience working with Healthcare/Pharmaceutical databases.<br>Experience with Claims Data / Claims Analytics.<br>Experience working with Patient-Level Data.<br>Hands-on experience with SAS / WPS / R.<br>Strong data interpretation and problem-solving skills.<br>Advanced Excel skills; VBA knowledge is preferred.<br>Good knowledge of reporting and data visualization.<br>Strong communication and analytical skills.<br><br>Preferred / Good to Have<br><br>Experience with IQVIA / IMS Health data assets.<br>Experience with APLD (patient-level data).<br>Exposure to healthcare data sources such as SHS, IQVIA, DRG, Labcorp, Flatiron, etc.<br>Experience with Rx Claims / Medical Claims.<br>Knowledge of HEOR studies.<br>Experience in Adherence Analysis, Line of Therapy and Treatment Path Analysis.<br>Healthcare or pharmaceutical domain experience.<br><br>Educational Qualification<br>Postgraduate degree in any of the following or related fields:<br><br>Economics<br>Statistics<br>Mathematics<br>Operations Research<br>Quantitative Analysis<br>MBA or related discipline .</span></div><div jsname="G7vtgf" class="TOQyFc Uzkg7d MmMIvd brKmxb" aria-controls="tsuid_evn4ao_dDb6y4-EP2pbpoQI_187" role="button" tabindex="0" jsaction="EMtXr" data-l="" data-hveid="CCsQPQ" data-ved="2ahUKEwiPguXl2IiYAxU-2TgGHVpLOiQQl5ACegQIKxA9"><hr class="Bi9oQd" aria-hidden="true"><div class="Wjtive btku5b rXoM2c sjVJQd"><div class="niO4u VDgVie SlP8xc"><span class="cHaqb"><span class="PBBEhf">Show full description</span></span><span class="T2xY9b w2fKdd z1asCe" aria-hidden="true" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M480-344L240-584l56-56L480-456L664-640l56,56L480-344Z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="XFOJCe" data-ved="2ahUKE