nce with any scripting language Strong organisational skills and attention to detail Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, high-volume, and deadline-driven environment Engineering and Technical degree mandatory Good interpersonal and communication skills Marketing / Advertising / Analytics related experience is preferred but not necessary Familiarity with the TV or Digital advertising ecosystem is helpful, but not mandatory Employment opportunities are available to all applicants without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.</span></div><div jsname="G7vtgf" class="TOQyFc Uzkg7d MmMIvd brKmxb" aria-controls="tsuid_evn4ao_dDb6y4-EP2pbpoQI_218" role="button" tabindex="0" jsaction="EMtXr" data-l="" data-hveid="CCkQPw" data-ved="2ahUKEwiPguXl2IiYAxU-2TgGHVpLOiQQl5ACegQIKRA_"><hr class="Bi9oQd" aria-hidden="true"><div class="Wjtive btku5b rXoM2c sjVJQd"><div class="niO4u VDgVie SlP8xc"><span class="cHaqb"><span class="PBBEhf">Show full description</span></span><span class="T2xY9b w2fKdd z1asCe" aria-hidden="true" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M480-344L240-584l56-56L480-456L664-640l56,56L480-344Z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="XFOJCe" data-ved="2ahUKEwiPguXl2IiYAxU-2TgGHVpLOiQQ5ZkFegQIKRBA"><div class="EyBRub" data-ved="2ahUKEwiPguXl2IiYAxU-2TgGHVpLOiQQyo8CegQIKRBB"><div jscontroller="Wo3n8" jsname="aadvhe" jsmodel=" d5EhJe" data-bkt="horizon_jobs" data-fhs="" data-maindata='[null,null,"bind(&#39;java/com/google/gws/plugins/horizon/jobs/viewer/herocontent/jslayout/feedback_messages.html#JobAtEmployer&#39;,{employer_name:&#39;TMF&#39;,job_title:&#39;Business \\x26 Data Analyst&#39;})","_evn4ao_dDb6y4-EP2pbpoQI_223",null,13,null,null,null,null,null,5025273,"horizon_jobs",[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[["share_link","