l,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,0]],"evn4ao_dDb6y4-EP2pbpoQI56":[[0,"https://jobs.fidelity.com/in/jobs/2132627/analyst-data-analytics-and-insights/","jobs","GGU_bL1jdoHt6M","\u003ch3\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3\u003eJob Description:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJob Description:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJob Title: \u003c/strong\u003eAnalyst, Data Analytics and Insights\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSponsorship: \u003c/strong\u003eFidelity will not provide immigration sponsorship for this position\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Role:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAre you passionate about turning data into actionable insights?\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs an Analyst in the \u003cstrong\u003eAnalytics Research \u0026 Data (ARD)\u003c/strong\u003e business unit at Fidelity Investments, you will play a pivotal role in driving data-driven decisions and strategies. Your work will be instrumental in identifying opportunities to craft the future of our financial services, making a significant impact on both our clients and the business. If you are looking for an opportunity to bring to bear your analytical skills in a dynamic and collaborative environment, this role is for you!\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eAssisting peers and leading data analysis projects to support business initiatives and decision-making\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCollaborating with cross-functional teams to identify and solve complex business problems\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAnalysing complex datasets to uncover the “why” behind trends and patterns, translating findings into actionable recommendations that drive informed decision‑making.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Expertise and Skills You Bring:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe are seeking an individual with a solid analytical foundation and demonstrated expertise in data analytics. You should be at ease handling large datasets and skilled at transforming data into practical insights. Here are the key qualifications:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eBachelor's or Primary degree in a related field (e.g. Data Science, Statistics, Computer Science), MBA or MS is an advantage.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e2-4 years of experience in data analysis or a similar area\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eProficiency in data analysis tools and programming languages such as SQL, Python, or R for data extraction, analysis, and validation.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExpertise in creating compelling, executive‑ready data visualizations using tools such as PowerPoint, Power BI and Tableau.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDemonstrate critical thinking and structured problem‑solving capabilities, with the ability to address the “so what” and “what if,” and recommend actions.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExcellent communication skills, with the ability to present complex data in a clear and concise manner\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eSkilled in translating business questions into testable hypotheses and validating them through experimentation or advanced analytics.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAbility to collaborate cross‑functionally, working effectively with diverse teams to align outcomes with organizational and customer goals.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eHigh curiosity, strong ownership mindset, and a commitment to continuous learning and improvement.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSupport quantitative and qualitative primary research studies, conducting secondary research scans. Familiarity with research basics such as creating research briefs, questionnaire design, sampling, weighting, hypothesis testing.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Team:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnalytics Research \u0026 Data (ARD)\u003c/strong\u003e is a forward‑looking insights organization focused on anticipating client needs and predicting future behaviours through data, analytics, customer research, and AI‑driven solutions. As part of ARD, your work will play a critical role in shaping Fidelity’s future—enhancing client experiences, enabling smarter decisions, and building enduring customer relationships.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp\u003eFidelity will reasonably accommodate associates with disabilities who need adjustments to participate in the application or interview process, or to perform the essential functions of their job.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCertifications:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCategory:\u003c/h3\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003c/h3\u003eBusiness Analytics and Insights","Analyst, Data Analytics and Insights",null,null,0,[["organization","Fidelity Investments Careers"],["organization_mid","/m/028q26"],["publisher_name","Fidelity Careers - Fidelity Investments"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bae1670c9b44e6d:0xf8dfc3e8517e4fe0"],["cluster_id","0x991ca8cd6519510a"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"evn4ao_dDb6y4-EP2pbpoQI59":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[43911100,0.19373974,4]]],"evn4ao_dDb6y4-EP2pbpoQI69":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Bengaluru+with+4+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003dgXZjvWw_ZRgnDw-aAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_x2OSwrCQBBEcZsjuOq1hEREN4oLPyjiIUInaSajk54w3ZFk5x28iUfyJI5uCgrq8Sp5T5LtjtGNoikcURH-TW0lgFzDhcWaRgU-zxfcfAlCGKoGPMPZe-NoumlUO1nnuYjLjChGNqt8m3um0g95hOQXhTQYqHOoVCxW8yHr2MyWJ1uTszpG0YNEW-LoOsQhBQHLsCc26PrQp3DFwPHgHb-IdsAqtQAAAA\u00