ive meaningful business insights.\nWork with patient-level transactional data and healthcare claims data.\nPerform analytics such as Adherence Studies, Line of Therapy (LOT), and Treatment Path Analysis.\nSupport HEOR studies and other healthcare analytics projects.\nDevelop and automate analytical and reporting processes.\nUtilize SAS/WPS/R for analytical and statistical modeling.\nIdentify opportunities to improve and automate existing analytical processes.\nPrepare reports and presentations using Excel and PowerPoint.\nWork independently and manage multiple projects while meeting deadlines.\n\nRequired Skills\n\n35 years of experience in Healthcare / Pharma / Life Sciences Analytics.\nStrong hands-on experience with Oracle PL/SQL.\nStrong knowledge of SQL and statistical analysis.\nExperience working with Healthcare/Pharmaceutical databases.\nExperience with Claims Data / Claims Analytics.\nExperience working with Patient-Level Data.\nHands-on experience with SAS / WPS / R.\nStrong data interpretation and problem-solving skills.\nAdvanced Excel skills; VBA knowledge is preferred.\nGood knowledge of reporting and data visualization.\nStrong communication and analytical skills.\n\nPreferred / Good to Have\n\nExperience with IQVIA / IMS Health data assets.\nExperience with APLD (patient-level data).\nExposure to healthcare data sources such as SHS, IQVIA, DRG, Labcorp, Flatiron, etc.\nExperience with Rx Claims / Medical Claims.\nKnowledge of HEOR studies.\nExperience in Adherence Analysis, Line of Therapy and Treatment Path Analysis.\nHealthcare or pharmaceutical domain experience.\n\nEducational Qualification\nPostgraduate degree in any of the following or related fields:\n\n\n\nEconomics\nStatistics\nMathematics\nOperations Research\nQuantitative Analysis\nMBA or related discipline .","Healthcare Data Analyst or Pharma Analytics-4 To 7 Years-Bangalore",null,null,0,[["organization","Sdna Global"],["organization_mid","/g/11t6g1lj09"],["publisher_name","Shine"],["loc